      "content": "thanks for these. they're okay but honestly they feel a bit generic, like standard HR stuff you could find anywhere. plus, my script is flagging these as pretty low on the theme coverage—it says the score is super low because you aren't actually using those specific pillar words i mentioned. \n\ncan you try again? i really need them to be better, but they also need to actually reflect our values so they hit that theme score. just try to integrate those concepts more naturally so the score isn't so low, but please keep them as actual useful, deep questions. don't make them sound weird/forced, just make sure the themes are actually present.",
